    "auth.present: true = secret/credential verified present in Actions; false = verified absent; null = unverified. Values are never recorded.",
    "headroom 1-5 = how much free allowance the planned workload leaves (5 = workload is a rounding error of the cap). lock_in 1-5 (5 = hardest to leave). fit 1-5 = fit to the ledger/queue/model/observability lanes that asked."
  ],
